WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
If your family wants to move, just look for him.

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,880
This young man is hardworking

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,840
And also strong

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,960
Very good attitude

5
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:05,920
No matter the boss

6
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,400
This is what the boy is like

7
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,040
Our house also needs renovation.

8
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,400
We build rental housing

9
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,400
There’s a lot of ingredients to make

10
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,680
But we can only use manpower to move it. Come and have a look.

11
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,760
There is no way to use the car here anymore

12
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,280
So they all have to be moved from here to our upstairs.

13
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,720
All the materials are here

14
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,460
Take a look at how much it costs

15
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,420
And it’s a long way and you have to carry it up

16
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,780
If we don’t have five thousand, we don’t need to borrow five thousand from the old man.

17
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,860
Five thousand

18
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,540
This is a bit too expensive, isn't it? Lao Lin, what's so expensive about this?

19
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,900
Don't even look at how far away you are from me. You still have to go upstairs.

20
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,860
You have so many things

21
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:35,820
Five thousand is considered cheap.

22
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,260
This guy will take care of you

23
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,140
This young man is really quick at what he does.

24
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,180
And he's not lazy either

25
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,460
Look at how many things we have in our house

26
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,700
People take one trip as three trips

27
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:43,820
Just look at people’s attitudes

28
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:47,820
This is more than money and should be given, okay, then five thousand yuan is fine.

29
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:54,140
Then let's get started.

30
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,700
Isn’t this tile heavy?

31
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,100
How can you move so much at once?

32
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,140
Let's go over and try the weight.

33
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,500
Ouch, it’s so heavy
